beszel-agent (0.21.1+devass1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging for beszel-agent.
  * Bundle upstream Go toolchain tarballs (go/go1.27.2.linux-*.tar.gz) and
    build with them directly, instead of depending on the distro's
    golang-go package, so the build always has a toolchain new enough
    to satisfy go.mod.

